# What never belongs inside a packaged chart. Argo CD reads this directory from git rather than
# from a package, so nothing here changes what a cluster gets today — it is what stops a working
# copy's noise being published the day one of these charts is packaged.

# Version control and the editor droppings that live beside it.
.git/
.gitignore
.bzr/
.hg/
.svn/
.idea/
.vscode/
.project
*.swp
*.tmproj

# The operating system's own files, which travel further than anyone expects.
.DS_Store

# Anything a test run leaves behind. A rendered manifest is an output of this chart and is never
# part of it.
.ci-out/
*.orig
*.rej

# **`charts/` is deliberately absent from this list.** The wrapped chart is resolved into that
# directory and a package without it is a package that renders one HTTPRoute and no collector.

